            "level": {
              "value": 6
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "When you cast grease, you can modify its target to be 1 creature. If you do, replace the spell's standard effects with the following: You splash the target with combustible grease. The target must attempt a Reflex save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target is splattered with grease and gains weakness 2 to fire until the end of your next turn. The target or an adjacent creature can rub off the combustible grease with an Interact action, ending the effect.\n- **Failure:** As success, except the weakness to fire lasts for 1 minute."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
